# Tools available to validation commands inside the workspace image (Python family of the platform
# command policy: pytest, ruff, mypy). Add a tool here only if CommandPolicy allows its executable.
pytest
ruff
mypy
# Web stack for repositories whose approved plan builds a FastAPI service (added for KAN-7, whose
# stored plan declares FastAPI/Uvicorn/Pydantic at runtime and httpx for FastAPI's TestClient).
# Installed at BUILD time only; the sandbox stays network-less (ADR C2). Dynamic per-repository
# provisioning is implemented as described in docs/decisions/ADR-010-dynamic-dependency-provisioning.md.
fastapi
uvicorn
pydantic
httpx
